{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/logo_text.png?t=1750235163\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/BUILDING.png?t=1750235163\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/2025-05-0703-08-18-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750235163\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Carbrix uses a Very simple building system</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Allowing you to build what you want, Almost how you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Carbrix you can build, Cars Bikes Planes And whatever comes to mind!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a simple to access anytime Buildmenu Stop Fix and GO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And when you're done, just save it and spawn it again anytime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/SANDBOX.png?t=1750235163\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712430/extras/2025-05-0703-16-57-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1750235163\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Carbrix has a Super fun SandBox mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SandBox mode, you have access to all the blocks in the game with endless possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make whatever you have been thinking, dreaming or wondering about!</p></l